# TAKING A PIECE APART AT A BENCH (GEAR.md G7): at a bench the making page lists
# every carried piece that can be taken apart, and what it gives back.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/salvage.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=mod_capacitor:1,axe_hand:1
coast calm
place spawn
wait 0.6
near bench
wait 0.4
tap craft
await app:crafting 4
wait 0.4
choose salvage_mod_capacitor
wait 0.4
shot 01-take-it-apart-at-the-bench with app:crafting
